// Physics 2.0 (issue #66): the character controller's playground — a
// walkable 30° ramp, a 50° one too steep to climb (a wall, a slide), stairs
// of 0.25 m steps a 0.3 m step height climbs, a one-way platform to jump up
// through, a low dome walked over as a triangle-mesh collider (`models/rock`'s
// `collision = "visual"`) and a trigger zone on the `pickup` layer. The hero
// has a `character` body: Play here (or `TRINO_SCENE=...`) walks it with
// `trino_core::physics::CharacterController`. `cargo xtask physics check`
// and `physics query` read this file; the editor shows its collider gizmos.
